{"version":1,"content":"<p>印尼山火引發嚴重有毒霧霾，並殃及鄰國新加坡和馬來西亞，引起國內外不滿。</p><p>印尼政府周四（15日）首度嘗試在空中投放乾冰驅散煙霧，改善空氣質素。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:00:14.951904+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":70,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:17:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:37:38.289254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:57:44.622923+00:00","content_hash":"36bdc5a80b8bc9c6d64fd7a0cb36c9de433fe1d977dada966e5f37d0e718233f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}